description	"The Light Infantryman

Light Infantry are a sub-elite branch of Infantry that forgoe heavier infantry weapons and armor/shielding to maximise their mobility. 

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (2)
- Blaster Rifle (2)
- CR-2 Repeating Pistol (2)
- 1 Concussion Grenade
- 1 Sonic Detonator

^6Equipment:
- Medpac (25HP+)

^8Attributes:
- 4 Reinforcements (CTF: 5.75s respawn)
- Assemble (1) - Respawns on characters with Rally

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (1) ^3[CS2]

^2Strengths^7: Fast and numerous, can be difficult to hit.
^1Weaknesses^7: Lacking in firepower and protection, limited ammunition."